language-prisma-schema
Prisma schema syntax highlighting for Pulsar.

This product includes a grammar derived from the TextMate grammar in the
official Prisma language tools:

  prisma/language-tools
  https://github.com/prisma/language-tools
  File: packages/vscode/syntaxes/prisma.tmLanguage.json
  Copyright Prisma Data, Inc.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Modifications: converted from JSON to CSON for Pulsar, restructured into
scoped attribute/argument/value rules, and changed or extended scope names
(comments, scalar types, model references, native-type attributes, named
arguments, built-in functions, escapes, constants and enum members) so that
standard Pulsar/Atom syntax themes color them.
